Batch mode

Simulation output goes to rawfile: zapote/power-entry/passive-reva/protection/operating-matrix-07/faults/compact-pacer-bench-18/pacer.raw
Comments and warnings go to log-file: zapote/power-entry/passive-reva/protection/operating-matrix-07/faults/compact-pacer-bench-18/ngspice.log

